      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm planning a business trip through japan soon. i need to get from tokyo to osaka and then up to fukuoka. is it usually better to just take the shinkansen for those legs or should i look into domestic flights? trying to figure out what's faster and more reliable for a tight schedule.",
