      "content": "that makes sense. i guess the train is safer for a strict schedule then. one more thing, since i'll be traveling alone, are there any specific tips for navigating these big stations or airports so i don't get lost or end up wasting too much time wandering around? i'm not super familiar with the layout of places like shinagawa or kansai airport.",
